														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2945209">
									

<p>If this article succeeds, and you want to use Murphy Law for your own skip, go right on ahead. Just keep in mind four things:</p>
<ul>
<li>If this article succeeds, I'm probably going to write an SCP document on him at some point in the near future.</li>
<li>Murphy Law plays by his own rules. He's out of control! He's a loose canon!</li>
<li>Whenever you include Murphy Law in a story, you must write that story while smooth jazz is playing. Also, it helps if you're at least slightly drunk.</li>
<li>If you write Murphy Law without his trilby, he will find you. He will find you, and he will <em>make you add the fucking trilby into your goddamn story.</em></li>
</ul>

